---10. ANTI-CHEAT, MONITORING, AND ENFORCEMENT
10.1. Anti-Cheat Consent. The Software may include anti-cheat and security technologies that operate on your device while running. These may inspect processes, memory, modules, files, drivers, and hardware identifiers to detect Cheats and threats. You expressly consent to such operation.

10.2. Detection and Evidence. ConfigFars may collect gameplay data, logs, and evidence to investigate violations.

10.3. Sanctions. Where ConfigFars determines you have violated this Agreement, it may apply:
a warning;
reset or rollback of progress, items, or currency;
temporary suspension;
permanent account ban;
device, hardware (HWID), or IP ban;
removal from events and forfeiture of prizes;
termination of the license;
reporting to authorities; and
civil and/or criminal action.

10.4. Sanctions for Cheating or fraud are generally non-refundable.

10.5. Ban Evasion. Creating another account or using another device to evade a sanction is a separate violation and may result in escalated sanctions.

10.6. Appeals. You may appeal through official channels. ConfigFars will review appeals but is not required to disclose detection methods.

